WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:09.590 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  [Applause]  the only rule is to rule the field  introducing the latest sport taking the  mushroom kingdom by storm  strike  mario strikers battle league football  strike is like football if football had  an electric fence no rules and intense  5v5 battles  sure you still dribble pass and shoot  for the goal  but with no fouls you can tackle thrash  and even stop your opponents in their  boots with items the controls are simple  so get a team together and let the games  begin but first here are some battle  tested striker strategies  [Music]  a team that tackles together scores  together  push a teammate for a team tackle that  covers extra ground for defense or  scoring  [Music]  get hands on and push your team to  victory literally  [Music]  another strat for star strikers is the  hyper strike  first get your gloves on a strike orb  when it appears on the pitch  charge it up  and let it rip  each character's hyper strike has a  different flourish and can score two  points by showing that net who's in  charge  [Music]  get rough pull off hyper strikes and  work together with your team to win  you'll have 10 total players on the  field with each character having their  own signature striker style  need a jack of all trades mario's your  man want to punish with power bowser's  the bomb need to score and shove with  speed that's peach's prowess  the rules may be  non-existent but protection is paramount  luckily some stat changing gear can be  equipped on characters heads body arms  and legs  boost speed for superior dribbling  up your strength to resist tackles  or up your shooting power for more  scoring potential  combine characters and gear to create  your superstar soccer squad  a total of eight yes eight players can  shoot their shot on the same console  even using a single joy-con controller  per player  you and another brave contender can get  together on the same console and show  your striker synergy online show no  mercy when playing against friends  family or rivals near and far  friendship can be forged amidst the  flames of strike like in the online only  striker's club mode where your own club  competes against others for rankings and  promotions  create your own club or join an existing  one  up to 20 strikers can join a club  [Music]  in striker's club you and your fearsome  friends play matches to accumulate  points each season  these points determine your club's  ranking so keep an eye on them  these matches can be played alongside  others in your club or you can strike  solo for points  your ranking at the end of each season  determines which division you'll compete  in during the next season  compete ruthlessly to earn points get  promoted and become the top club you can  also get demoted so the stakes are high  aside from an official sounding title  club owners also get to manage members  and customize kits best of all as club  owner you can give some flair to your  lair by customizing the club stadium  with different goals and pitch designs  two club stadiums will smash together in  striker's club matches to form a single  stadium  get gritty with mario and friends in  strike  where anything goes  mario strikers battle league football  available june 10th only on the nintendo  switch console

